<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/universe647" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4376536); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4376536&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609252312" alt=" Universe647" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4376536)" /></a> <a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/universe647" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4376536); return false;">Universe647</a></span></p>
